# Generative vs Edit-Based vs Data-Driven Watermarking

## 1. Overview

Text watermarking can be applied at different stages of the LLM
pipeline:

1.  **Generative watermarking** --- watermark during text generation.
2.  **Edit-based watermarking** --- modify already-generated text.
3.  **Data-driven watermarking** --- alter the model's training data so
    particular triggered outputs become watermarked.

